 {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [79], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Japanese fresh campus-photography style with high saturation, high contrast, rich light layering, true color reproduction, youthful energy, and a bright lively everyday impact. An APS-C 50mm standard-lens look emulates f/2.0, 1/1000s, ISO 200, daylight white balance, and continuous autofocus, keeping the young East Asian high-school girl's face and hands sharp while the corridor light at the far end dissolves softly. The camera holds a near-static rule-of-thirds composition with a diagonal guiding line, placing her slightly right of center so she occupies the right two-thirds of the frame and leaving open space toward the left in the direction of her gaze. She stands before neatly arranged blue-green metal lockers whose smooth surfaces carry small specular highlights, brass-colored locks, handwritten paper labels, some with Japanese characters, and lightly worn edges that show use. The foreground includes a partial locker edge acting as a visual frame; the midground holds the full row of lockers and the girl as the main focus; the background runs down a grey tiled corridor toward a blurred glowing light source, creating depth and perspective. She has deep brown shoulder-length short hair with natural bangs above the brows, fine features, and a lively direct look into the lens with a slightly playful glint. Her lips are gently parted around a translucent straw, expression vivid and natural. Her right hand rises to the back of her head, fingers lightly touching the hair, while her left hand holds a transparent plastic bottle filled with pale-blue liquid; the bottle has a minimal label and the liquid shifts slightly with the grip. She wears a classic Japanese school uniform: a crisp white short-sleeve shirt with a structured collar, a neatly tied red necktie, and a dark pleated skirt ending above the knee, with fine fabric texture and even folds. Light comes from the right-rear as a bright backlight that rims her hair with warm gold, while soft frontal fill keeps the face evenly lit and shadows gradual with no hard edges. The locker faces catch small high-light points that emphasize metal texture. Motion stays minimal and lifelike: her eyes hold the camera, the straw remains between her lips, her right fingers smooth the hair once, the bottle tilts slightly, and the pleats settle as her weight shifts. The palette centers on blue-green, white, and red, accented by warm yellow flare, suggesting an energetic afternoon school corridor.\noverall_soundscape: A quiet school-corridor room tone continues underneath, with a faint metal locker resonance and soft tile reflection in the space. A small plastic-bottle flex, a light hair touch, and a subtle straw contact sound appear once, without any spoken voice."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [510, 330], "pos": [-210, 6130], "id": 35, "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-ns", "ver": "44de705818d4663fefefde57ffe0ea5a9ea39df4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [95], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [0, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 83, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_index"}, "name": "batch_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次索引"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "长度"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ImageFromBatch", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [380, 200.8980712890625], "pos": [-618.439453125, 7